      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This does seem like it could help a select few and I think it's a good idea 💡 \n\nSadly vrchat isn't the most fastest to act on cases for harassment as I have experienced first hand many times.\n\nSo sadly I feel they will brush this idea off or take years to implement it.\n\nWish U all the best and hope this small change can help even if it's just a filter to allow ppl to only add U if in the same instance as U.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
